    {
      "id": "claim_daf71ade027a4879a29dd26382180b81",
      "statement": "openwiki-launcher 的核心架构是「清单快照 + 后台按需启动」：宿主的 initialize 由内置 manifest 快照即时应答，tools/list 仅在后端尚未启动时才用快照回答、后端就绪后转真实后端，tools/call 一律排队等待真实 openwiki 后端就绪后透传。",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/broker.mjs#L11-L17",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:76d945658c7c94f901a55b08324c55e8626ec2b3d4de60e034dd5fed1580c3ff:"
        },
        {
